  "solution": {
    "text": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">This is hydrohalogenation reaction of alkene. This is an electrophilic addition reaction. Addition occurs via Markovnikov&#39;s rule.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>HBr</mi></math> adds to the double bond of the styrene forming 1-bromo-1-phenylethane.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0114_fed157d63e2e.png\" style=\"width: 450px; height: 117px;\" /></p>"
